synonym: "histone kinase activity (H2A-S121 specific)" EXACT []
synonym: "histone serine kinase activity (H2A-S121 specific)" EXACT [GOC:mah]
synonym: "histone-serine kinase activity (H2A-S121 specific)" EXACT [GOC:mah]
