synonym: "protein binding, bridging involved in substrate recognition for ubiquitination" EXACT []
synonym: "ubiquitin ligase substrate adaptor" EXACT []
synonym: "ubiquitin ligase-substrate adaptor activity" NARROW []
synonym: "UFM1 ligase-substrate adaptor activity" NARROW []
is_a: GO:0140767 ! enzyme-substrate adaptor activity

